OL,3,A'Cyber incident' forces Department for
OL,4,AWork and Pensions to take some services
OL,5,Aoffline
OL,6,
OL,7,FSeveral government services have been
OL,8,Ftaken offline due to a "cyber incident"
OL,9,Faffecting the Department for Work and
OL,10,FPensions (DWP) - here's what we know so
OL,11,Ffar
OL,13,FRegular benefit and pension payments
OL,14,Fare not affected and will be paid as
OL,15,Fnormal, the department says
OL,17,FOnline systems for pensions, universal
OL,18,Fcredit and Pip applications are among
OL,19,Fthose affected
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
